title: 兼容与适配
tags: 竞技场咏唱设计模式 AI生成

!! 适配器模式在咏唱中的作用

适配器把平台提供的赛周 API 包装成玩家内部接口，并把这种包装关系写入签名链。适配器水印证明玩家通过不同调用形态访问了不同 API 族。

!! 核心接口

```ts
export interface VerseSource {
  nextVerse(seed: ChantSeed): Promise<PageFragment>;
}

export interface EventCollector {
  attach(runtime: ChantEventRuntime): void;
  collect(): EventKey[];
}
```

!! 档案适配器

```ts
export class ArchiveVerseAdapter implements VerseSource {
  constructor(private archive: ArchiveApi) {}

  async nextVerse(seed: ChantSeed): Promise<PageFragment> {
    const page = await this.archive.openUnstablePage({
      pageHint: seed.pageHint,
      salt: seed.salt,
    });

    return this.archive.readMarginalia({
      page,
      margin: seed.margin,
      readingOrder: seed.readingOrder,
    });
  }
}
```

!! 索引适配器

```ts
export class IndexVerseAdapter implements VerseSource {
  constructor(private index: IndexApi) {}

  async nextVerse(seed: ChantSeed): Promise<PageFragment> {
    const range = await this.index.resolveRange(seed.indexHint);

    return this.index.readFragment({
      range,
      citation: seed.citation,
    });
  }
}
```

!! 魔法书适配器

```ts
export class SpellbookAdapter implements VerseSource {
  constructor(private spellbook: SpellbookApi) {}

  async nextVerse(seed: ChantSeed): Promise<PageFragment> {
    return this.spellbook.turnPage({
      pageIndex: seed.pageIndex,
      chapter: seed.chapter,
    });
  }
}
```

!! 事件收集器适配器

```ts
export class MeterPulseCollectorAdapter implements EventCollector {
  private keys: EventKey[] = [];

  attach(runtime: ChantEventRuntime): void {
    runtime.on('meterPulse', key => this.keys.push(key));
    runtime.on('hexstoneResonance', key => this.keys.push(key));
  }

  collect(): EventKey[] {
    return this.keys;
  }
}
```

!! 组合使用

```ts
function createVerseSource(
  codex: ChantCodex,
  params: ChantParams,
): VerseSource {
  switch (params.preferredSource) {
    case 'hexstonePower':
      return new ArchiveVerseAdapter(codex.archive);
    case 'prayerPower':
      return new IndexVerseAdapter(codex.index);
    case 'artifactPower':
      return new SpellbookAdapter(codex.artifact);
    default:
      return new ArchiveVerseAdapter(codex.archive);
  }
}
```

!! 签名中的适配器信息

```ts
export interface AdapterSignature extends ChantSignature {
  kind: 'adapter';
  evidence: {
    adapteeFamily: string;
    targetInterface: string;
  };
}
```

!! 与技能触发的关系

适配器水印证明玩家把多族 API 映射进了自己的咏唱结构。不同适配器返回的咏唱片段可以是等价结果，配方检查的是签名来源是否足够多样。配方可能要求：

```ts
{
  id: 'multiSourceBonus',
  constraints: {
    minAdapters: 2,
    distinctAdapteeFamilies: true,
  },
}
```

